                                                                        <div class="position-relative d-inline"><button type="button" title="Zobacz szczegóły wydarzenia o 20:00" class="position-relative btn btn-sm btn-accent-dark py-1 px-2 mb-1 mr-1 text-white pointer rounded-0 event-button" data-movie="2347" data-event="15338">20:00</button><div class="tooltip"></div></div>
